DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Attention Trading Partners: MIHMS Upgrade Oct
 ober Payment Cycle Changes and System Access Limitations
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Attention Trading Partners: MIHMS Upgrade October Payme
 nt Cycle Changes and System Access Limitations\nAttention Trading Partners
 : MIHMS Upgrade October Payment Cycle Changes and System Access Limitation
 s\nOct 05\, 2026\nAs\npreviously communicated\n\, the Office of MaineCare 
 Services (OMS) is preparing to launch an upgraded version of MIHMS\, Maine
 Care’s claims processing system. The upgrade is currently scheduled to g
 o live on October 10\, 2026. To support a smooth transition\, OMS must imp
 lement temporary system access limitations and adjustments to payment cycl
 es in October.\nFrom now until Monday\, October 12 at 8:00 AM\, MIHMS is i
 n a “data freeze” while OMS completes final system readiness and trans
 ition activities.\nFor all information about the upcoming changes to MIHMS
 \, see the “HealthPAS Online Portal” section of the\nProvider Resource
 s\npage. Please note that we have updated the\nFAQ\npreviously shared\, as
  of September 21\, 2026.\nChanges to October payment cycles:\nReview this 
 information and plan billing accordingly to prepare for the transition.\nP
 ayment Cycle Date\nType of Cycle\nClaim Submission Deadline for Inclusion 
 in Payment Cycle*\nWednesday\, 9/30/26\nLast regular payment cycle before 
 the data freeze\nFriday\, 9/25/26\, 5:00 AM\nThursday\, 10/1/26\nExtra\npa
 yment cycle before the data freeze\nWednesday\, 9/30/26\, 5:00 AM\nThere w
 ill be no payment on Wednesday\, October 7.\nThursday\, 10/15/26\nFirst pa
 yment cycle after data freeze\, in upgraded system\nSecure File Transfer P
 rotocol (SFTP) submission: Continuous through data freeze up to Tuesday\, 
 10/13/26\, 2:00 PM\nPortal submission:\nBefore data freeze: Friday\, 10/2/
 26\, 7:59 PM\nAfter data freeze: Tuesday\, 10/13/26\, 2:00 PM\nWednesday\,
  10/21/26\nRegular payment cycle\, in upgraded system\nFriday\, 10/16/26\,
  5:00 AM\n*As always\, timely submission does not guarantee that the claim
  will process in time for the next \nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/provid
 ers/provider-bulletins/attention-trading-partners-mihms-upgrade-october-pa
