DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			MaineCare Provider Conference Tickets\nMaineCare Provid
 er Conference Tickets\nOct 01\, 2026\nDue to high interest in the MaineCar
 e\nProvider Conference\n\, we have reached capacity for\ngeneral\nattendan
 ce tickets. However\, additional tickets may become available\, and you ca
 n still join the waitlist.\nTo reserve your spot on the waitlist\, visit t
 he\nconference registration page\nand click “Reserve My Spot.”\nIf a t
 icket becomes available\,\nEventbrite will automatically contact you by em
 ail\nwith instructions for completing your registration.\nYou will have 48
  hours from the time the email is sent to claim your available ticket.\nAr
 e you a Delivery System Reform Unit (DSRU) provider\, exhibitor\, or prese
 nter?\nTickets are still available for these groups. If you are a DSRU pro
 vider\, exhibitor\, or presenter\, please use the\npromo code provided to 
 you\nto access your designated registration ticket. You do not need to joi
 n the general attendance waitlist.\nPlease monitor your email\, including 
 your spam or junk folder\, for updates. Being placed on the waitlist does 
 not guarantee that a ticket will become available.\nFor questions about th
 is conference\, please contact\nMaineCare’s communication team\n.\nWe ap
 preciate your interest in the conference and hope to see you in October!\n
